"右","leaf":"二十一下","column_from_right":2,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"後遂與之為亂明年妃謁敬后廟東昏即位為"},{"pdf_page":24,"half":"右","leaf":"二十一下","column_from_right":3,"start":0,"end":18,"text":"皇后帝寵潘妃后不被遇黃淑儀生太子誦而"},{"pdf_page":24,"half":"右","leaf":"二十一下","column_from_right":4,"start":0,"end":17,"text":"卒東昏廢后及誦並為庶人后父澄自有傳"}]},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-011-chulingqu-izumo","book_id":"b-nanshi-011","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-chulingqu-izumo"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chulingqu:p001","text":"東昏褚皇后諱令璩，河南陽翟人，太常澄之女也。建武二年，納為皇太子妃而無寵。帝謂左右曰：「若得如山陰主無恨矣。」山陰主，明帝長女也，後遂與之為亂。明年，妃謁敬后廟。東昏即位，為皇后。帝寵潘妃，后不被遇，黃淑儀生太子誦而卒，東昏廢，后及誦並為庶人。后父澄自有傳。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chulingqu:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"東昏","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"篇首冠所配君主之號。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chulingqu:p001:m0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"褚皇后","person_id":"6fs_tis_zoa_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"傳主后號。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chulingqu:p001:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"令璩","person_id":"6fs_tis_zoa_AA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"傳主名字。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chulingqu:p001:m0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"澄","person_id":"6fs_tis_zoa_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"父名。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chulingqu:p001:m0047","start":47,"end":50,"surface":"山陰主","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_G","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段字位。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chulingqu:p001:m0055","start":55,"end":58,"surface":"山陰主","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_G","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段字位。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-chulingqu:p001:m0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"明帝","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段字位。"},{"i